WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.435
-We're down to the second...

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.737
-Dude,
game's on in five minutes.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.339
Got any snacks?

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:10.276
-Wings? Chips? Beer?

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:13.579
-This party's in trouble.
[ Doorbell rings ]

00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:17.149
♪♪

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:19.718
-Not anymore.
[ Cassette player clicks ]

00:00:19.718 --> 00:00:22.088
-♪ We are
the Football Party Patrol ♪

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.923
♪ Getting your party
out of control ♪

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:26.259
♪ So when you need snacks
for the big game ♪

00:00:26.259 --> 00:00:28.528
♪ Call the Party Patrol,
we'll save the day ♪

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.463
♪ Got the wings marinating
in the fridge ♪

00:00:30.463 --> 00:00:31.864
-♪ With the sauce so hot,

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:33.633
it'll burn your lips ♪
[ Wilhelm scream ]

00:00:33.633 --> 00:00:35.201
-♪ If you need a drink,
well, we got 'em all ♪

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:36.502
-♪ Cheese curls, cheese puffs,

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:37.937
and of course ♪
-♪ Cheese balls ♪

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:39.972
-♪ Got a jersey on
of your favorite player ♪

00:00:39.972 --> 00:00:42.442
-♪ Got that dip
made of seven layers ♪

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.377
-♪ All our friends
coming to this house ♪

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.679
♪ Just use a napkin,
don't wipe on the couch ♪

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:48.848
-♪ And I brought
15 pounds of cod ♪

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:51.383
♪ I caught it in the sea
with my fishing rod ♪

00:00:51.383 --> 00:00:53.653
♪ Cod is the perfect
football snack ♪

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.122
♪ Loaded with omega-3s,
that's the good fat ♪

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:59.892
[ Music stops ]
Sounds good, right? Guys?

00:00:59.892 --> 00:01:02.895
-♪ Cool, but what about
the chips and guac? ♪

00:01:02.895 --> 00:01:05.198
♪ All I want to do
is eat that guac ♪

00:01:05.198 --> 00:01:07.267
♪ I wish I could
get paid in guac ♪

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.535
♪ Avocado, jalapeños,
how I like to rock ♪

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:11.704
-♪ Then bop a jalapeño popper ♪

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:13.939
♪ Queso so hot,
it's a bopper shocker ♪

00:01:13.939 --> 00:01:16.109
♪ Can't get enough
of these football snacks ♪

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:18.744
-♪ But it stinks like fish,
and that's kinda wack ♪

00:01:18.744 --> 00:01:20.813
-♪ That's on account
of the cod I brought ♪

00:01:20.813 --> 00:01:23.249
♪ I put it in the microwave
to make it hot ♪

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:25.451
♪ The bad smell's
from the fishy steam ♪

00:01:25.451 --> 00:01:27.820
♪ Crammed with phosphorous
and protein ♪

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.023
-♪ Maybe we could put the cod
in the freezer ♪

00:01:30.023 --> 00:01:32.358
-♪ Or we could eat it,
that'd be easier ♪

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:34.593
-♪ How about we put all the cod
outside? ♪

00:01:34.593 --> 00:01:36.829
-♪ Sure, then I'll bring
more cod inside ♪

00:01:36.829 --> 00:01:39.131
-♪ Maybe we could put the cod
in the trash ♪

00:01:39.131 --> 00:01:41.434
-No! No!
[ Record scratches ]

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:44.837
Nobody's going to be putting
the cod in the trash!

00:01:44.837 --> 00:01:48.173
Everybody is going to eat
the cod because I brought it,

00:01:48.173 --> 00:01:49.508
and that's the end of it.

00:01:49.508 --> 00:01:51.811
That's the end of it!

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:54.747
If someone brings a dish
to a party, you try it.

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:55.648
You try it.

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:58.151
Just one bite, okay?
One bite.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:01:59.452
That's it. That's the rule.

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:03.255
That's the Party Patrol
politeness rule.

00:02:03.255 --> 00:02:05.558
Just one bite.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.860
♪♪

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.530
[ Squishing ]

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:15.835
♪♪

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:20.139
[ Munching ]

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:23.876
[ Munching continues ]

00:02:23.876 --> 00:02:27.013
-♪ So, maybe we were
too hard on the cod ♪

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.349
-♪ Now you're on your way
to a killer bod ♪

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:31.550
-♪ A football snack
fresh from the sea ♪

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:33.886
-♪ Dense, white flesh,
yeah, that's for me ♪

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:36.255
-♪ We are
the Football Party Patrol ♪

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:38.291
♪ Getting your party
out of control ♪

00:02:38.291 --> 00:02:40.426
♪ So if you need snacks
for your squad ♪

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:43.462
♪ Call the Party Patrol,
and we'll bring the cod ♪

00:02:43.462 --> 00:02:46.566
-Cod goals!
[ Squish! ]

